Total assets at December 31, 2023 were **$13,215.2 million**, equal to the reported total liabilities and stockholders’ equity. [on-fy2023:b164] Net income attributable to ON Semiconductor Corporation for fiscal 2023 was **$1,902.2 million**. [on-fy2023:b165]

\[
\text{Return on assets}
=\frac{1{,}902.2}{13{,}215.2}\times 100
=\mathbf{14.39\%}
\]

